{"seq":3,"slug":"get-up-recovery","title":"起身与恢复：从物理躺回动画站","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ragdoll-physics/blending/get-up-recovery","wordCount":1487,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"起身与恢复-从物理躺回动画站\">起身与恢复：从物理躺回动画站</h1><p>被击倒的角色最终得站起来——除非它死了。起身（get-up / recovery）是布娃娃闭环的最后一段：把一具停稳在地上、朝向随机的物理躯体，平滑地交还给动画状态机，让它自然地爬起、回到可控角色。这一段常被低估，却是玩家感知&quot;这个角色是活的&quot;的关键。做砸了，角色会从地上&quot;瞬移&quot;回站姿，或以扭曲的姿势弹起，前面所有 <a href=\"animation-to-ragdoll\">动画到物理过渡</a> 的功夫都白费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>起身是布娃娃闭环的收尾：把一具停稳在地、朝向随机的物理躯体平滑交还给动画。它由四步串成——停稳检测、朝向判断、根节点对齐、姿势匹配淡出——每一步做砸都会让角色瞬移或弹跳，前功尽弃。本篇逐步拆解这条从物理躺回动画站的路径，并说明主动布娃娃为何能免去这套流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第一步-判断-停稳了\">第一步：判断&quot;停稳了&quot;</h2><p>起身不能在布娃娃还在翻滚时就触发，得先确认它真的停稳。判据是所有刚体的动能足够低并持续一小段时间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ω</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ω</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>持续 </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_k = \\sum_i \\left( \\tfrac{1}{2} m_i \\|\\vec{v}_i\\|^2 + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\,\\vec{\\omega}_i^{\\top} I_i\\,\\vec{\\omega}_i \\right) &lt; \\epsilon \\quad \\text{持续 } T_{settle}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"to